sequenceDiagram
    participant User as Usuario QA
    participant UI as Frontend (ejecutor.js)
    participant API as FastAPI (executions.py)
    participant Service as ExecutionService
    participant Oracle as Base de Datos Oracle

    User->>UI: Clic en Ejecutar (Ingresa Password)
    UI->>API: POST /api/execute/test-case/{id}
    API->>Service: execute_test_case(id, profile, password)
    Service->>Oracle: connect(user, password, dsn)
    activate Oracle
    Oracle-->>Service: Conexión Establecida
    Service->>Oracle: Ejecutar SQL Query
    Oracle-->>Service: Resultado (Rows affected / Cursor)
    Service->>Service: Evaluar Validación (ROW_COUNT / EXISTS)
    alt DML (INSERT/UPDATE/DELETE) o Error
        Service->>Oracle: ROLLBACK
        Oracle-->>Service: Rollback Completo
    else SELECT Exitoso
        Service->>Oracle: Omitir Rollback
    end
    deactivate Oracle
    Service->>API: Retornar HistoryRecord (PASS/FAIL)
    API-->>UI: 200 OK (JSON)
    UI->>User: Mostrar Modal de Resultados
